1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,120
25 Nisan 1915, şafak.

2
00:00:03,370 --> 00:00:04,310
Binlerce asker

3
00:00:04,390 --> 00:00:05,570
Arıburnu'na çıkıyor.

4
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:06,740
Tepeler düşerse,

5
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:07,920
Çanakkale düşer.

6
00:00:08,190 --> 00:00:09,340
Yarbay Mustafa Kemal'in

7
00:00:09,390 --> 00:00:10,820
elinde tek bir alay var.

8
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:12,290
Ama yukarıdan emir yok.
